# Line-ending policy. Matches inexion-clocks, which is the reference copy.
#
# The repository always stores LF. eol=lf also forces LF in the working tree on
# checkout, on every platform, so a Windows editor that saves CRLF no longer
# makes git report untouched files as modified.
#
# Added 2026-08-20. Only 2 of 55 tracked files had drifted here, but the repo had
# no policy, so it was one bad save away from the state the other repos were in.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
